---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import { links } from '@/data/privia';
---
<!-- VERIFY with Privia legal before launch: this website policy must not duplicate or contradict the Privia HIPAA Notice of Privacy Practices. Confirm the privacy contact, the list of service providers, and state privacy-rights wording. -->

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How the Pain Management Specialists website collects, uses and protects information, and the choices you have." lead="This policy explains what information our website collects, how we use it, and the choices you have. It is written in plain language on purpose.">
  <div class="callout"><p><strong>Your health information is different.</strong> This policy covers this website. How we handle your medical records and health information is described in the <a href={links.hipaa} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privia Notice of Privacy Practices</a> and on our <a href="/hipaa">HIPAA and Your Privacy Rights</a> page. If the two ever differ for health information, the Notice of Privacy Practices applies.</p></div>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>This website is for {site.name}, a care center of Privia Medical Group, with offices in Rockville and Frederick, Maryland. In this policy, “we” and “us” mean {site.name}.</p>

  <h2>Please do not send health details through this website</h2>
  <p>This website does not have forms for health information. Please do not send medical details by email or social media. To share health information, call your office or use the secure patient portal.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <h3>Information you give us</h3>
  <p>If you call or write to us, we receive the information you share, such as your name, phone number and the reason you are reaching out. Booking a visit happens in Find-A-Doctor, and the patient portal is run by Privia. Those services have their own privacy terms.</p>
  <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Technical data such as your IP address, browser type, device type, the pages you open and the date and time. Our hosting provider keeps this in standard server logs.</li>
    <li>Your cookie choices, saved in your browser. See our <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>.</li>
    <li>If you choose to load a Google map, Google receives information from your browser as described in Google’s own policy.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To run, secure and fix the website.</li>
    <li>To answer your calls and messages.</li>
    <li>To understand which pages are useful, but only if you allow analytics. We do not use analytics tools right now.</li>
    <li>To follow the law and protect our patients, our staff and our systems.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We do not share it for advertising.</p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Service providers</strong> who help us run the website, such as hosting and security. They may only use the information to provide that service.</li>
    <li><strong>Privia Medical Group and its affiliates</strong>, which support our care centers.</li>
    <li><strong>Others when the law requires it</strong>, or to protect rights, safety and security.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> change your choices at any time with “Cookie Preferences” in the footer.</li>
    <li><strong>Global Privacy Control:</strong> if your browser sends this signal, we keep analytics and marketing off.</li>
    <li><strong>Browser settings:</strong> you can block or delete cookies in your browser. Some parts of the site, like maps, may then not work.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your privacy rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to ask what personal information we hold about you from this website, to ask us to correct or delete it, and to ask us not to sell or share it. We do not sell or share it. To make a request, call us at <a href={`tel:${site.phone.tel}`}>{site.phone.display}</a>. We will not treat you differently for asking.</p>
  <p>Your rights over your <em>medical records</em> are covered by HIPAA. See <a href="/hipaa">HIPAA and Your Privacy Rights</a>.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep information</h2>
  <p>We keep website logs only as long as needed for security and troubleshooting. We keep your cookie choices for up to 180 days, then ask again.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>We use reasonable safeguards, including encrypted connections (HTTPS), to protect information. No website can promise perfect security.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This website is meant for adults. It is not aimed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their personal information.</p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>Our site links to other sites, such as Privia and Find-A-Doctor. We are not responsible for their content or privacy practices. Please read their policies.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. We will change the “Last updated” date at the top when we do.</p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy? Call <a href={`tel:${site.phone.tel}`}>{site.phone.display}</a> or contact an office:</p>
  <ul>
    {site.locations.map((l) => <li>{l.name}: {l.street}, {l.city}, {l.state} {l.zip}, <a href={`tel:${l.phone.tel}`}>{l.phone.display}</a></li>)}
  </ul>
</LegalLayout>
